Cycle derivation: the decomposition specified in ADR-0003.

Consumed by the editor for render columns, but not owned by it -- ADR-0001
makes this a specified component rather than a rendering detail, and no
component may store its output.

Mirrors backend/src/phasor_workbench/cycles/, and is held to it by the
fixtures in shared/fixtures/decomposition/. Empty until Milestone 2.
